@startuml
!include ../_style.iuml
title Epic 5 — Memory and Studio

rectangle "Memory" {
  card US5_1 [
    **US-5.1  Tell the assistant about myself**
    As a //reader//, I want to type "/memory <fact>" and have it remembered,
    so that later answers take me into account.
    ----
    * Facts are extracted on a worker and acknowledged in the chat.
    * The closest facts are added to each prompt and listed under the answer.
  ]
}
rectangle "Studio" {
  card US5_2 [
    **US-5.2  Study from my sources**
    As a //student//, I want a quiz, flashcards and a mind map generated from a notebook,
    so that I can revise what I uploaded.
    ----
    * Generation runs on a worker; the tile shows progress and the result opens in place.
    * Quiz answer keys are checked against the options, not trusted as an index.
    * Asking again while one is generating returns the one in progress.
  ]
}
US5_1 -[hidden]down- US5_2
@enduml
